<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-λύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help in undoing</i> or <i>putting down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.68
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				16.5
			</span></i>; <i>put down also</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀκεῖνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					67
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. βίον ἅμα τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Isoc.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; <i>help to reduce</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληθώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).725
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὴν δύναμιν ἑαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.607
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.598
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>halt</i> or <i>stop for the night together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.94a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cease together with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				64.118
			</span></i>.</div>
